Chapter: ItemDesignerApp
  cites Explorer chapter ExplorerTheme

 Item designer. Compiled through the HTML plug.
 DOM stubs, theme types, and dark-gold theme from ExplorerTheme.

 We say:

Section: Data

  ItemCategory = record { name : Text, prompt : Text }
  RarityTier = record { name : Text, color : Text, glow : Text }
  MaterialType = record { name : Text, prompt : Text }

  item-categories : List ItemCategory
  item-categories = [
    ItemCategory { name = "Longsword", prompt = "ornate fantasy longsword, straight double-edged blade, cruciform crossguard, leather-wrapped grip" },
    ItemCategory { name = "Katana", prompt = "elegant katana, curved single-edged blade, circular tsuba, wrapped handle, Japanese style" },
